        <p class="boot-line">Loading modules.................. [OK]</p>
        <p class="boot-line">Establishing neural network....... [OK]</p>
        <p class="boot-line">Mounting /dev/experience.......... [OK]</p>
        <p class="boot-line">Starting server on port 443....... [OK]</p>
        <p class="boot-line">&nbsp;</p>
