                      <h3>MorphoCLIP: Text-Supervised Cell Painting Retrieval</h3>
                      <p>
                        Matches microscope images of treated cells to a plain-language description of the drug
                        or gene behind the change. The DINOv3 and BioClinical ModernBERT encoders stay frozen
                        and only small heads are trained, so one consumer GPU is enough. Tested on CPJUMP1 (51
                        plates, 3M+ images).
                      </p>
                      <div class="project-tech">
                        <span>PyTorch</span>
                        <span>DINOv3</span>
                        <span>BioClinical ModernBERT</span>
                        <span>Contrastive Learning</span>
