                        <h3>Localize, Don't Beautify: Controlling Image-Editing APIs</h3>
                        <p>
                          Image editors asked to change one facial feature tend to retouch the whole face, which
                          ruins a surgical preview. I tried three client-side fixes across six commercial
                          editors and 196 edits, checking identity with ArcFace and whether each edit stayed
                          put. Plain masked compositing worked best.
                        </p>
                        <div class="project-tech">
                          <span>Image-Editing APIs</span>
                          <span>Inpainting</span>
                          <span>ArcFace</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="project-links">
                          <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.02841" target="_blank">
