                  <div class="research-content">
                    <p class="grep-filename">./papers/melanoma/<span class="grep-match">research</span>.py:<span
                      class="grep-line-num">1</span></p>
                      <h3>MelanomaNet: Explainable Skin Lesion Classification</h3>
                      <p>
                        A nine-class skin-lesion classifier (EfficientNet V2, focal loss) with 0.86 weighted F1
                        on 25K ISIC 2019 images. Its GradCAM++ heatmaps are broken down by the ABCDE criteria
